            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.1+2CH.4.2+2CH.4.3+2CH.4.4+2CH.4.5+2CH.4.6+2CH.4.7+2CH.4.8+2CH.4.9+2CH.4.10+2CH.4.11+2CH.4.12+2CH.4.13+2CH.4.14+2CH.4.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 4:1-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Abakaludaaya baasheenyagura enyomyo z'emiringa ezaabaire ziri omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'ebitebe by'ebinaabiro, n'ekitanka ky'emiringa, ebyabaire biri omu nju ya MUKAMA, baatwara emiringa yaabyo yoona Babulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatwara enyungu n'ebyoma eby'okuyooza eiju, na makansi, n'enyabya, n'enyabya z'obubaane, n'ebindi bintu by'emiringa byona ebyabaire bikoresibwa omu murimo gwa hekalu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'enyabya nkye, n'eby'okuguhisa omuriro, n'enyabya mpango, n'enyungu, n'ebikondo by'etabaaza, n'eby'okutamu obubaane, n'enyabya z'empongano ez'ebirikushukwa. Ebintu ebyabaire bikozirwe omu zaabu, omukru w'abarinzi yaabitwara biri ezaabu, n'eby'efeeza yaabitwara biri efeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomyo ziri zombi, n'ekitanka, n'enimi z'miringa ikumi na ibiri, ezi ekyo kitanka kyabaire kitairweho, n'ebitebe by'ebinaabiro, ebi omugabe Sulemaani yaakozire kukoresa omu nju ya MUKAMA, emiringa yaabyo yoona ekaba etarikubaasa kupimwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eby'ezo nyomyo, oburaingwa bw'emwe bukaba buri mikono ikumi na munaana, obuhango bwayo okugyehinguririza mikono ikumi n'ebiri, n'omuzimba gwayo enkumu ina, kandi omunda eri omurangara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha mutwe gwayo ekaba eine omutwe gw'omikono etaano; hashobeekaineho ebiri nk'akatimba n'amakomamahanga, byona biri emiringa, okugwehinguririza. Enyomyo ya kabiri nayo ekaba eine ebirikushusha bityo hamwe n'amakomamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mbaju zaayo hakaba harimu makomamahanga makumi mwenda na maukaaga; n'amakomamahanga goona agaabaire gari ahari ako katimba gakaba gari igana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
