              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaatwara Seraaya omunyamurwa omukuru na Zefania omunyamurwa wa kabiri n'abakumiirizi b'aha irembo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi omu rurembo yaihamu omukuru w'engabo owaabaire naategyeka abaserukare, n'abashaija mushanju b'omu ishengyero ry'omugabe, abashangirwe omu rurembo, n'omuhandiiki w'omukuru w'eihe owaabaire ahandiika abantu b'omuri egyo nsi, kandi n'abashaija makumi mukaaga b'omuri egyo nsi abashangirwe omu rurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabatwara, yaabahitsya omugabe wa Babulooni omuri Ribula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe wa Babulooni yaabateera, yaabaitira Ribula omu nsi ya Hamasi. Batyo Abayuda baihwa omu nsi yaabo, baatwarwa bari enkwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 24:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ogu nigwo mubaro gw'abantu abu Nebukadeneeza yaatwaire bari enkwatwa; omu mwaka gwa mushanju akatwara Abayudaaya enkumi ishatu na makumi abiri na bashatu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana yaiha omuri Yerusaalemu abantu magana munaana na makumi ashatu na babiri, yaabatwara bari enkwatwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri n'eshatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Nebukadeneea, Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaatwara Abayudaaya magana mushanju na makumi ana na bataano; abntu boona abaatwairwe bakahika enkumi ina na magana mukaaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
